---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../../components/Hero.astro';
import ProductGrid from '../../components/ProductGrid.astro';
import FAQAccordion from '../../components/FAQAccordion.astro';
import QuoteForm from '../../components/quote/QuoteForm.tsx';
import { serviceSchema } from '../../lib/schema/service';
import { faqPageSchema } from '../../lib/schema/faqPage';
import { getAllProducts } from '../../data/catalog/shopify';
import '../../styles/quote-form.css';

const allProducts = await getAllProducts();
const products = allProducts.filter((p) => p.tags.includes('themed') || p.tags.includes('custom')).slice(0, 9);

const faqs = (await getCollection('faq'))
  .filter((f) => f.data.pages.includes('custom'))
  .sort((a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order)
  .map((f) => ({ question: f.data.question, body: f.body.trim() }));

const schemas = [
  serviceSchema({
    name: 'Custom themed balloon installations',
    description:
      'Fully custom themed balloon installations designed from a concept or palette and built for events in London Ontario.',
    startingPrice: 299,
    url: '/services/custom-themed',
  }),
];
if (faqs.length > 0) {
  schemas.push(faqPageSchema(faqs.map((f) => ({ question: f.question, answer: f.body }))));
}
---

<BaseLayout
  topic="Custom Themed Balloon Installations"
  description="Custom themed balloon installations in London Ontario. Designed from your concept, palette, or reference photo and built to order. Themed builds from $299."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
    { name: 'Services', url: '/services' },
    { name: 'Custom themed installs', url: '/services/custom-themed' },
  ]}
  schemas={schemas}
>
  <Hero
    eyebrow="Install type"
    headline="Custom themed balloon installations in London, Ontario"
    subhead="Start with a reference photo, a mood board, or a colour you cannot find anywhere. Brenda designs the build from there."
    primaryCta={{ href: '/quote', label: 'Start a quote' }}
    secondaryCta={{ href: '/portfolio', label: 'See custom work' }}
    image="/images/categories/centerpieces.webp"
    imageAlt="Custom themed balloon installation"
    variant="page"
  />

  <section class="install-body section">
    <div class="container container-narrow prose">
      <p>
        Every install we build is made to order, so custom is the normal rather than the upgrade. This
        page is for the ones that start from a concept rather than a category. A quinceañera with a
        specific palette, a brand activation that has to match a colour code exactly, a kid's party
        built around one character, or an idea you have only ever seen in a photo.
      </p>

      <h2>What a custom themed build costs</h2>
      <p>
        Smaller themed setups start at $299. Full themed builds combining several elements, an arch with
        a wall and matching table pieces, run $599 to $1,500. Large multi-element concepts for
        quinceañeras, galas, and brand activations go beyond that depending on scale and how many
        separate pieces the room needs.
      </p>
      <p>
        Custom does not automatically mean more expensive. A themed build at the same size and colour
        count as a catalog build prices close to it. What raises the number is scale, the number of
        separate pieces, unusual colours that have to be sourced, and anything that needs a frame or a
        structure built to hold it.
      </p>

      <h2>How the design actually works</h2>
      <p>
        Send whatever you have. A Pinterest board, a screenshot, a photo of your invitations, a fabric
        swatch, or just a description of the feeling you are going for. Brenda works from that to a
        proposed build, comes back with what is possible in your space and budget, and adjusts before
        anything is committed. If your reference photo is a setup that would not work in your venue, she
        will say so and offer the version that does rather than building something that fails on the day.
      </p>
      <p>
        Colour matching is the request we get most. If you have a brand hex code, a bridesmaid dress
        swatch, or a specific shade in mind, we match to it rather than picking the nearest standard
        colour. Some shades are not manufactured in latex at all, and in those cases we will tell you
        honestly what the closest achievable match looks like before you book.
      </p>

      <h2>Give it more lead time</h2>
      <p>
        Custom concepts need longer than catalog builds. Four to six weeks is comfortable, and specialty
        colours or anything needing a built structure benefit from more. Shorter timelines are often
        still possible for smaller themed setups, so ask rather than assuming. Timelines and rush
        bookings are covered in the <a href="/faq">FAQ</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        For brand activations and corporate concepts specifically, see
        <a href="/services/corporate">corporate packages</a>. Individual elements are covered on
        <a href="/services/balloon-arches">arches</a>,
        <a href="/services/balloon-garlands">garlands</a>, and
        <a href="/services/walls-backdrops">walls and backdrops</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {products.length > 0 && (
    <section class="install-products section">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="section-head">
          <p class="eyebrow">Shop the catalog</p>
          <h2>Themed builds in the catalog</h2>
          <p class="lede">Useful as a starting point when you would rather adapt than start blank.</p>
        </header>
        <ProductGrid products={products} columns={3} />
        <p class="section-link-wrap">
          <a class="section-link" href="https://shop.balloonia.events/collections/themed-setups">View all themed setups →</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  )}

  {faqs.length > 0 && <FAQAccordion heading="Custom build questions" faqs={faqs} />}

  <section class="install-quote section">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="section-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Custom build</p>
        <h2>Have a concept in mind?</h2>
        <p class="lede">Send the reference, mood board, or colour code. Brenda designs from it and quotes within 24 hours.</p>
      </header>
      <QuoteForm client:load />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose p { color: var(--color-ink-soft); font-size: var(--font-size-lg); line-height: var(--line-relaxed); }
  .prose h2 { margin-top: var(--space-6); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
  .prose a { color: var(--color-accent-deep); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  .section-head { margin-bottom: var(--space-6); }
  .install-quote { background: var(--color-paper-soft); }
  .section-link { color: var(--color-accent-deep); font-size: var(--font-size-sm); font-weight: 500; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  .section-link-wrap { margin-top: var(--space-5); }
</style>
